+3.  **Ambient Reflection:**
+    $$ L_{amb}(\tilde{x}) = L_l \cdot k_a $$
+    $k_a$ is the ambient color coefficient. This term ensures voxels with gradients pointing away from the light source do not appear pitch black [S3].
 
